<section class="band container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">faq</span>
    <h1 class="section-title">Everything people ask.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Privacy, offline use, languages, billing — if it's not here, write to us and we'll answer (and add it).</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">What is Super Flow?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>A voice-to-text dictation app for Windows. Press F9 in any text field, speak, and Super Flow types polished text — filler words removed, grammar fixed, punctuation added.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Is my audio uploaded anywhere?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Not on the Free plan — all transcription runs locally with Whisper. On Pro with Deepgram, audio streams to Deepgram and OpenAI for transcription and cleanup; we never log or store your audio. Privacy Mode stops anything from being written to disk.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Does it work offline?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes, with the local Whisper engine and rule-based cleanup. Cloud features (Deepgram, GPT-4o-mini, read-aloud voices) require an internet connection.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Which apps does it work in?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Anywhere there's a text field — Gmail, Word, Google Docs, Slack, Discord, VS Code, Cursor, Notion, Obsidian, Linear, Figma, ChatGPT and more. It types into whatever window has focus.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">What languages are supported?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Twelve: English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, Russian, and Hindi — switchable mid-session from the recording overlay.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Which operating systems are supported?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Windows 10 and 11 today. macOS is on the roadmap.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Which hotkey triggers dictation?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>F9 by default. You can change it to any function key or modifier chord in Settings → General.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">What's the difference between Free and Pro?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Free gives you 2,000 words/week with local Whisper + rule-based cleanup. Pro adds Deepgram streaming, GPT-4o-mini style transfer, meetings, Flow Lens, read-aloud, and unlimited words for $15/month.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Can I use my own OpenAI or Deepgram API keys?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Settings → General → Advanced lets you provide your own keys instead of using the Pro-included infrastructure.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Where is my data stored?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Locally in a SQLite file at %APPDATA%/Super Flow/super-flow.db. Your transcripts, dictionary, snippets, and settings never sync to a server.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">How do I cancel my Pro subscription?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>From your Stripe billing portal, accessible inside the app under Settings → Account → Billing. Pro features stay active until the end of your current paid period.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Is there a refund policy?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Within 14 days of upgrading, email us and we will refund your most recent payment in full.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">How do I report a bug?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Open an issue at github.com/man-vu/super-flow-releases, use Help → Send feedback inside the app, or email us — all routes are monitored daily.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

